H6825.def:
A man of the Edomites living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 36:11; 
son of: Eliphaz (H0464); 
brother of: Teman (H8487), Omar (H0201), Gatam (H1609), Kenaz (H7073), Amalek (H6002H) and Korah (H7141H) 
§ Zepho or Zephi = "watch-tower"
son of Eliphaz and grandson of Esau and one of the chiefs of the Edomites

H6827.def:
A man of the tribe of Gad living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:16; 
son of: Gad (H1410); 
brother of: Haggi (H2291), Shuni (H7764), Ezbon (H0675), Eri (H6179), Arod (H0720) and Areli (H0692); also called Zephon at Nombres 26:15; 
Another name of tsiph.yon (צִפְיוֹן "Ziphion" H6837) 
§ Zephon = "treasure"
a son of Gad and progenitor of the family of Zephonites

H6831.def:
Someone descended from Zephon who was a man of the tribe of Gad living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:16; 
son of: Gad (H1410); 
brother of: Haggi (H2291), Shuni (H7764), Ezbon (H0675), Eri (H6179), Arod (H0720) and Areli (H0692); also called Zephon at Nombres 26:15; 
Group of tsiph.yon (צִפְיוֹן "Ziphion" H6837) 
§ Zephonites, of Zephon "treasure"
descendants of Zephon, the son of Gad

H6837.def:
A man of the tribe of Gad living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:16; 
son of: Gad (H1410); 
brother of: Haggi (H2291), Shuni (H7764), Ezbon (H0675), Eri (H6179), Arod (H0720) and Areli (H0692); also called Zephon at Nombres 26:15; 
§ Ziphion = "lookout"
1) a son of Gad and progenitor of the family of Zephonites
1a) also 'Zephon'

H6846J.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 6:24; 
son of: Tahath (H8480H); 
father of: Uzziah (H5818H); also called Zephaniah at 1 Chroniques 6:36; 
Another name of u.ri.el (אוּרִיאֵל "Uriel" H0222G)
§ Zephaniah = "Jehovah has treasured"
1) the 9th in order of the 12 minor prophets; descendant of king Hezekiah of Judah and prophet in the time of king Josiah of Judah
2) son of Maaseiah and second priest in the reign of king Zedekiah of Judah; succeeded Jehoiada and an officer of the temple; slain at Riblah on the capture of Jerusalem
3) father of Josiah and Hen in the time of the prophet Zechariah
4) a Levite

H6847.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 30:24; 
son of: Israel (H3478) and Rachel (H7354); 
brother of: Benjamin (H1144); 
half-brother of: Reuben (H7205), Simeon (H8095), Levi (H3878), Judah (H3063), Dan (H1835H), Naphtali (H5321), Gad (H1410), Asher (H0836), Issachar (H3485), Zebulun (H2074) and Dinah (H1783); married to Asenath (H0621); 
father of: Manasseh (H4519) and Ephraim (H0669); also called Zaphenath-paneah at Genèse 41:45; 
Another name of yo.seph (יוֹסֵף "Joseph" H3130G) 
§ Zaphnath-paaneah = "treasury of the glorious rest"
a name given by Pharaoh to Joseph

H6855.def:
A woman living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Exode 2:21; 
daughter of: Jethro (H3503); 
sister of: Eliasaph (H0460) and Hobab (H2246); married to Moses (H4872); 
mother of: Gershom (H1647) and Eliezer (H0461H) 
§ Zipporah = "bird"
daughter of Reuel or Jethro, wife of Moses, and mother of Gershom and Eliezer

H6870.def:
A woman living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Samuel 26:6; 
daughter of: Jesse (H3448) and Nahash (H5176I); 
sister of: David (H1732), Eliab (H0446I), Abinadab (H0041I), Nethanel (H5417H), Raddai (H7288), Ozem (H0684), Abigail (H0026H)(?) and Elihu (H0453J), Shimeah (H8093) 
§ Zeruiah = "balsam"
sister of David and mother of the 3 leading heroes of David's army-Abishai, Joab, and Asahel

H6872C.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of United Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Samuel 9:1; 
son of: Becorath (H1064); 
father of: Abiel (H0022)
§ Zeror = "bundle"
grandfather of Ḳish

H6874.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 25:3; 
son of: Jeduthun (H3038); 
brother of: Obed-edom (H5654), Mattithiah (H4993H), Gedaliah (H1436I), Jeshaiah (H3470H) and Hashabiah (H2811I); also called Izri at 1 Chroniques 25:11;
Also named: yits.ri (יִצְרִי "Izri" H3339) 
§ Zeri = "built"
son of Jeduthun and a musician in the court of David

H6882.def:
Someone descended from Zorath(?), first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 2:53; also called Zorite at 1 Chroniques 2:54; 
§ Zorites or Zorathites, of Zorah "hornet"
the inhabitants of Zorah

H6889.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 4:7; 
son of: Ashhur (H0806) and Helah (H2458); 
brother of: Haahashtari (H0326), Izhar (H3328), Ethnan (H0869) and Koz (H6976); 
half-brother of: Ahuzzam (H0275), Hepher (H2660) and Temeni (H8488) 
§ Zereth = "splendour"
son of Ashur, the founder of Tekoa, by his wife Helah
